<title>BOTSWANA: Botswana yr/yr inflation drops to 9.1 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>Botswana yr/yr inflation drops to 9.1 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>GABORONE 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Botswana's all-items consumer price index rose 0.7 percent in January from December, bringing the year-on-year increase to 9.1 percent, the Central Statistics Office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>				Jan 1997	 Dec 1996	Jan 1996</p>
<p>    Yr/Yr pct change    9.1		9.6	     10.5</p>
<p>    All-items index     101.3	    100.6	   92.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Index November 1996 = 100</p>
<p>-- Gaborone newsroom +267-347182</p>
</text>
